@AuthentificationApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5120

### Connexion d'un utilisateur existant (API de gestion requise)
POST {{AuthentificationApi_HostAddress}}/api/authentication/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "user1"
}

### Login inexistant (API de gestion requise)
POST {{AuthentificationApi_HostAddress}}/api/authentication/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "unknown-user"
}
